        "body": "**Cat:** $4 + 5 = 9$ dots.\n\n**Dog:** $5 - \\text{dog} = 2$. Which number taken away from 5 leaves 2? $5 - 3 = 2$, so the dog hides 3 dots.\n\n**Answer: (C) 9 and 3**"
